{"id":"wb-7-1492","name":"惠远钟鼓楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"惠远钟鼓楼","text":"惠远城钟鼓楼是位于新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州霍城县的清代惠远新城钟鼓楼。惠远城钟鼓楼保存完整，在新疆较为罕见，是全国重点文物保护单位。\n惠远城钟鼓楼占地面积484平方米。台基为墩台，其上为三层三重檐歇山顶楼阁。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%83%A0%E8%BF%9C%E9%92%9F%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":93118670,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93118670","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4d9ee1b39d0ad55a3721a9b3.jpg","title":"惠远钟鼓楼.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%83%A0%E8%BF%9C%E9%92%9F%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/%E6%83%A0%E8%BF%9C%E9%92%9F%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​惠远钟鼓楼","width":320,"height":240}}